  "question": "Where can I find gallery that lies within 80 kilometers en route to Ogunquit Heritage Museum, Ogunquit, ME from Mount Washington Boat Terminal, Wolfeboro, NH?",
  "sql": "WITH\n    angle AS (SELECT degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-71.21302 43.583693)',4326)::geography, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-70.6004 43.24471)',4326)::geography)) AS value)\nSELECT * FROM pois,angle\nWHERE tourism = 'gallery'\nAND ST_DWithin(pois.geometry, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-71.21302 43.583693)',4326)::geography, 80000)\nAND (degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-71.21302 43.583693)',4326)::geography, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN angle.value - 22.5 AND angle.value + 22.5);\n",
